  "details": "I would love to see, as an optional turning method, an implementation of flick stick aiming.\nThis video helps explain flick stick better than I could (just substitute gyro with the headset in context): https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C5L_Px3dFtE\nI feel this would be a turning method that would be able to provide much more precise and less fiddly turning as seen in comfort turning, without as much nausea as smooth turning (seeing the lack of or minimal existence of acceleration). \nIt would also provide better fidelity of movement for competitive worlds, such as Hook Junkers.",
